ica preços mais altos?"],["Seller","Yes. Less supply, more demand.","Sim. Menos oferta, mais demanda."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Redução de palavras funcionais (to, of, for, and, can)","items":[{"label":"Redução de palavras funcionais (to, of, for, and, can)","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Explain supply and demand.","pt":"Explique.","model":"Less supply means higher prices."},{"q":"Use imply.","pt":"Use.","model":"That implies a problem."},{"q":"Use scarce.","pt":"Use.","model":"Water is scarce here."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 4-panel script about supply and demand.","model":"Panel 1: Apples are scarce this year. Does that imply higher prices? Panel 2: Less supply, more demand. Panel 3: If there had been more apples, they would have been cheaper. Panel 4: Economics 101! I’ll have one.","checklist":["Usei **supply/demand**","Usei **imply**","4 quadros"],"words":"4 quadros"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “fruit stall” mean?","opts":["safra de maçã","demanda do mercado","barraca de frutas"],"ans":2,"why":"**fruit stall** = barraca de frutas."},{"q":"What does “apple crop” mean?","opts":["safra de maçã","alta de preços","recurso escasso"],"ans":0,"why":"**apple crop** = safra de maçã."},{"q":"What does “price rise” mean?","opts":["demanda do mercado","alta de preços","lei econômica"],"ans":1,"why":"**price rise** = alta de preços."},{"q":"What does “market demand” mean?","opts":["recurso escasso","vendedor de frutas","demanda do mercado"],"ans":2,"why":"**market demand** = demanda do mercado."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e p